[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":280},["ShallowReactive",2],{"IwA1UQP5rlqTZg-uaYC1lSNf60UHFgvLNvKMJjFc3K0":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":5,"excerpt":14,"hero":15,"heroAsset":29,"location":42,"sector":43,"services":47,"introCopy":48,"storyblockAccordions":49,"storyblockAssets":59,"flexibleContent":94,"footerLinkLabel":272,"footerLinks":273},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"Lotte Dongtang","Shed redefines retail for Lotte Dongtan, transforming 16,000 sqm into a dynamic retailtainment destination that elevates shopping as a leisure experience",null,"lotte-dongtang",false,{"hex":11},"#FFFFFF",{"hex":13},"#1C1C1C","Creating a retailtainment destination with three floors of fashion retail.",{"title":16,"subtitle":17},"\u003Cp>Lotte\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Dongtang\u003C/p>",{"value":18,"links":28},{"schema":19,"document":20},"dast",{"type":21,"children":22},"root",[23],{"type":24,"children":25},"paragraph",[26],{"type":27,"value":14},"span",[],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":33},900,"",1600,{"width":34,"height":35,"url":36,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":37},3200,1822,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086506-shed-lotte-dongtan-2613-web.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":38,"srcSet":39,"src":40,"width":34,"height":35,"sizes":41},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086506-shed-lotte-dongtan-2613-web.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086506-shed-lotte-dongtan-2613-web.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086506-shed-lotte-dongtan-2613-web.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086506-shed-lotte-dongtan-2613-web.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086506-shed-lotte-dongtan-2613-web.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086506-shed-lotte-dongtan-2613-web.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086506-shed-lotte-dongtan-2613-web.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086506-shed-lotte-dongtan-2613-web.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086506-shed-lotte-dongtan-2613-web.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200","(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Dongtan, South Korea",[44],{"slug":45,"label":46},"retail","Retail","Interior Design, Landscape Design","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Shopping has always been a leisure activity. When Lotte asked Shed to be the lead designer on 16000 sqm of new retail in Dongtang, we knew it was all about reframing this time old tradition to create a retailtainment destination.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[50,53,56],{"title":51,"copy":52},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Create a destination shopping experience that feels uniquely Lotte. Each floor needs to be distinctly, different, rich in character and depth of experience, yet all united in their aim to offer a customer-first experience. \u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>3F - Women&rsquo;s Contemporary\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>4F - Family (Mens &amp; Children&rsquo;s) \u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>5F - Sports.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":54,"copy":55},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>The starting point was a deep understanding of Lotte&rsquo;s customer base, forming the basis of a tailored retail strategy for each floor. The perfect balance of retail, entertainment and services emerged, transforming traditional departments into immersive, experience-led destinations.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":57,"copy":58},"The Solution","\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>Storytelling design at its finest, with each floor creating a memorable and distinct shopping experience. \u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>The flowing shapes and forms of the women&rsquo;s department, inspired by the fluidity of the natural world, transitions into a lush outdoor terrace, where hidden sculptures and sanctuaries invite a moment of pause. \u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>A children&rsquo;s department takes shoppers on a whimsical journey through folklore and curiosities, designed to ignite imagination and make shopping an adventure. \u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>A sports department with a unexpected nod to the past where the grandeur of ancient Olympic amphitheaters is reimagined in a contemporary, high-energy setting.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>Credits: Video content by Lotte.\u003C/span>\u003C/div>",[60,72,82],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":61},{"width":62,"height":63,"url":64,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":65},2096,1178,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086735-shed-lotte-dongtan-2772-web.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":66,"srcSet":67,"src":68,"width":69,"height":70,"sizes":71},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086735-shed-lotte-dongtan-2772-web.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086735-shed-lotte-dongtan-2772-web.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086735-shed-lotte-dongtan-2772-web.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086735-shed-lotte-dongtan-2772-web.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086735-shed-lotte-dongtan-2772-web.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086735-shed-lotte-dongtan-2772-web.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086735-shed-lotte-dongtan-2772-web.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086735-shed-lotte-dongtan-2772-web.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094 2094w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731086735-shed-lotte-dongtan-2772-web.jpg?fit=crop&w=2094",2094,1177,"(max-