&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731316809-shed-lotte-dongtan-1342.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731316809-shed-lotte-dongtan-1342.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731316809-shed-lotte-dongtan-1342.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731316809-shed-lotte-dongtan-1342.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731316809-shed-lotte-dongtan-1342.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731316809-shed-lotte-dongtan-1342.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731316809-shed-lotte-dongtan-1342.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731316809-shed-lotte-dongtan-1342.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",1807,{"_modelApiKey":137,"title":138,"sideCopy":139,"mainCopy":140},"module_title_copy","3F - WOMEN'S CONTEMPORARY","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Dedicated to women&rsquo;s contemporary fashion and hosting local, premium brands curated for the Lotte customer.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Shed brought the outside world in by connecting retail and terrace landscapes though the use of natural materials and forms, all reimagined through a luxury lens. The result is a natural haven of luxury retail for the modern mindset of the Dongtan women.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"_modelApiKey":142,"assetPosition":143,"isWide":9,"assets":144},"module_framed_asset","left",[145],{"copy":31,"asset":146},{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":147},{"width":148,"height":149,"url":150,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":151},2448,1498,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317073-shed-lotte-dongtan-1045-web.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":152,"srcSet":153,"src":154,"width":155,"height":156,"sizes":157},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317073-shed-lotte-dongtan-1045-web.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=cro