ace - the &lsquo;Gateway&rsquo;. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>The Children&rsquo;s Department is wrapped in playful architecture taking you on a journey of children&rsquo;s folklore and curiosities to pique the imagination of children and adults alike. Menswear is a different kind of exploration: A rich mix of past, present and future.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"_modelApiKey":96,"asset":187},{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":188},{"width":189,"height":175,"url":190,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":191},3144,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317243-shed-lotte-dongtan-2310-web.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":192,"srcSet":193,"src":194,"width":34,"height":195,"sizes":41},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317243-shed-lotte-dongtan-2310-web.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317243-shed-lotte-dongtan-2310-web.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317243-shed-lotte-dongtan-2310-web.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317243-shed-lotte-dongtan-2310-web.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317243-shed-lotte-dongtan-2310-web.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317243-shed-lotte-dongtan-2310-web.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317243-shed-lotte-dongtan-2310-web.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317243-shed-lotte-dongtan-2310-web.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1731317243-shed-lotte-dongtan-2310-web.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",2042,{"_modelApiKey":197,"isReversed4060":83,"assets":198},"module_side_by_side_asym",[199,211],{"copy":31,"asset":200},{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":201},{"width":155,"height":202,"url":203,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":204},